<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Jan-Apr '97 coconut crop up 0.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Jan-Apr '97 coconut crop up 0.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's coconut crop in the first four months of this year rose 0.9 percent to 832.3 million nuts from 824.7 million nuts in the same period last year, the Central Bank said in its latest economic report.</p>
<p>Coconut production had fallen two percent to 614.1 million nuts in the first quarter against the same period last year.</p>
</text>
